{
	"info": {
		"name": "OQM - E2E reset",
		"description": "End-to-end scenario for resetting the ticket numbering, run against the real running server.\n\nCreates 3 services (Payment, Delivery, Assembling) and 2 counters (c1: Payment + Delivery, c2: Delivery + Assembling), lets some clients take tickets, resets the services and checks that the next tickets start again from 001.\n\nRun the backend first (from `backend`: `fastapi dev API/API.py`), then run the collection in order with the Collection Runner or:\n\n    newman run OQM_E2E_reset.postman_collection.json\n\nNote: the reset restarts the numbering of every service in the db, not only the 3 created here.\n\nChange `baseUrl` in the collection variables if the server is not on localhost:8000.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000"
		},
		{
			"key": "runId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "paymentId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "deliveryId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "assemblingId",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "c1Id",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "c2Id",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "01 - Setup: services and counters",
			"description": "Story: as an admin, I create the services and configure the counters.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Admin creates the service Payment",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"runId\", Date.now());"
								]
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status is 201 (service created)\", () => {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"const service = pm.response.json();",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Service is Payment with no tickets yet\", () => {",
									"    pm.expect(service.name).to.eql(\"Payment\");",
									"    pm.expect(service.num_tickets).to.eql(0);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"paymentId\", service.id);",
									"console.log(`Created Payment (id ${service.id})`);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/services",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"services"
							]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Payment\",\n    \"service_time\": 5\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						}
					}
				},
